t datum. OpenStreetMap water outlines did not match here, so widths use the 80 m default and the water outline is drawn from the channel line. Experimental: Northern Ireland has no open flood-defence data and only 10 m terrain here, so quay walls and embankments are missing and flooding is overstated; the tide gauge and terrain height datums have not been checked against each other."}}